  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>&bull; Brand Introduction:</strong></span> <br>CopGain is a pioneering brand that understands the need for professionals to work from anywhere. By breaking down barriers with innovative technology, we empower individuals to work smarter and more efficiently, regardless of their location or task. Join us in rewriting the rules of work and embracing a limitless future of productivity.<br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&bull; Product Description:</span> <br></strong>The best portable monitor for laptops CopGain P1M is designed specifically for MacBook users. The P1M has a built-in Type-C cable hidden in the body. When you want to use it, just plug and play. You don&rsquo;t need to carry extra cables, adapters, or chargers in your backpack when you work on the go. The P1M is also compatible with all Mac OS and HiDPI scaling, so you don&rsquo;t have to worry about any display issues. Moreover, the P1M has four models for 13.3&rsquo;&lsquo;, 13.6&rsquo;&lsquo;, 14&rsquo;&lsquo;, and 16&rsquo;&rsquo; MacBook, so you can choose the one that fits your laptop size.&nbsp;<br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</span> <br></strong>1. Snap and Set up - No more extra settings, you can attach the P1M by snapping it on and off like a phone/iPad/laptop case, or using double-sided nano tape for a more long-term mounting solution, which can be easily applied and removed without any trace.<br>2. True Portability - The P1MP only weighs 1.87 lbs and has a built-in Type-C cable hidden in the body. When you want to use it, just plug and play.&nbsp; <br>3. Multi-function Pads - The CopGain P1M contains two versatile pads: one Aluminum, and one PU, both with magnetic properties. These stylish, easy-to-clean pads double as mouse pads or coasters and can be detached for your convenience.&nbsp;</p>",
